{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Machinicide is a fast-paced FPS with bullet-hell influences. Crush all evil robots to scraps with a huge arsenal of futuristic weapons and your ability to change gravity while evading massive amounts of projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Looter shooter ad absurdum</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who needs to reload when you have a near-endless supply of guns at your disposition. Just throw away your used up guns for cool explosions on impact and pick up new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Turn enemies to Pi\u0148atas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running out of weapons to shoot? Just point your hand on enemies to turn them into more weapons while enjoying a shower of confetti.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SAVES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saves from demo are compatible with the full game</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2012400?t=1741807652","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2012400?t=1741807652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012400/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741807652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012400/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741807652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Machinicide is a fast-paced FPS with bullet-hell influences. Crush all evil robots to scraps with a huge arsenal of futuristic weapons and your ability to change gravity while evading massive amounts of projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Looter shooter ad absurdum</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who needs to reload when you have a near-endless supply of guns at your disposition. Just throw away your used up guns for cool explosions on impact and pick up new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Turn enemies to Pi\u0148atas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running out of weapons to shoot? Just point your hand on enemies to turn them into more weapons while enjoying a shower of confetti.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SAVES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saves from demo are compatible with the full game</p>","developers":["\u0160t\u011bp\u00e1n Meister"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1897010","name":"Machinicide"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012400/header.jpg?t=1741807652","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> tested on Linux Mint<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> ryzen 3 1200 / Core i3-7100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 ti / AMD Radeon R7 265<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113588,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113588/movie480.mp4?t=1741807650","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113588/movie_max.mp4?t=1741807650"},"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113588/df107189641be0ea19eb90bf86056f7055be6f4a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741807650","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113588/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741807650","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113588/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=174180